A||||16||fierospeeder||aftermath of the  WTC incident     ||||1||
Z||000000||fierospeeder||11-05-2001||02:15 AM||||just wanna see what your opinions are.<P><BR>I watch a lot of tv.  24-7.  And i see couple movies.  And sometimes they are placed in new york and i get to see the WTC and it gives that errie feeling.  <P>Theres some singer, that did a video 5 days before the disaster, and he has the WTC in the background in his video. <P>How do you feel when you see the building in old movies?<P><BR>Im sick of these pakistans?  neighbors that are taking their side because we are killing innocent people.    You know when we accidently kill ten people, but its okay when they killed 5,000 est.  They dont say anything about that and their freaking college kids protesting in their gay pride parades saying were the "wrong".  <P>No im not racist but heres a story.  I worked at my dads work during the summer/winter days off from school.  And there was a middleeastern college kid.  He accused me of sexual harassment, freaking joke.  And they told me i had to leave when i start school up again.  <P>Only reason he did it, was 1, he didn't like me, or 2 it was a pathetic excuse for him not to work because 7am was to early and 8 hour days are too long.    I work with several black guys, they were the best friends i had there.  We would joke around, and they would say, ya, those people are back stabbers.   <P>they said this was my 2nd chance and i blew it, because i insulted some guy before, 3 years ago.  So they said i have a "history".  But those 3 years, i never gotten into trouble.   It did suck in some ways, it was a machine shop setting, so i got to learn about polishing, grinding, i got to sand blast.  mop the floor woohoo.  <P><BR>My mom was watching cable.  We got cable in our trailer home.  Just joking.  <BR>They had a thing about the middle easterns.  When i looked on the screen, they were doing public executions.  It doesn't look too governmental.  Some guy in rags, cuts the guy with a knife.  And theres just people running around in the background.  I just totally hate their culture, and it is sick.  Not as sick as the other cultures i seen in asia and african tribes.  But to portray your culture as something close to god is a joke.  <P>I would hate to be a woman there.  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroMaster88||11-05-2001||03:25 AM||||The only thing that kind of weirded me out was the documentary they showed on the discovery channel on the WTC.  They filmed and showed it earlier this year and aired it again after the incident.  Above most the people they interviewed it said "missing since 9/11/01"  One of the guys they interviewed worked on one of the middle floors.  In his interview he said he thought the building would survive the impact of a large jet.  Now that is errie!  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierospeeder||11-05-2001||03:39 AM||||When i was a kid.  Yesterday.  In junior high, we had a trade of toys with other kids.  So i got a "believe it or not" book.<P>In the book, it states that a WWII bomber plane ran right into the empire state building during a fog.  <P>I have no idea where the book is, so i cant give exact quotes.  It does show a cartoon drawing of the plane being stuck in the side.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fierowrecker||11-05-2001||09:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierospeeder:<BR><B>When i was a kid.  Yesterday.  In junior high, we had a trade of toys with other kids.  So i got a "believe it or not" book.<P>In the book, it states that a WWII bomber plane ran right into the empire state building during a fog.  <P>I have no idea where the book is, so i cant give exact quotes.  It does show a cartoon drawing of the plane being stuck in the side.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I saw the program on Discovery about the Empire State building, and it showed the damage and the repair to it after the plane hit...<BR>Fortunately, it was when planes were smaller...<BR>crash...<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||WampusCat||11-05-2001||10:08 AM||||Also WWII bombers cruised at about 150-200 mph down low.  The 757's that hit the WTC were probably doing over 400 mph.  Mechanical energy = 1/2mass*(velocity squared) so doubling the mass doubles the energy, doubling the speed quadruples the energy.<P>Actually, it wasn't the mech. energy that brought the towers down.  The heat from the jet fuel drew the hardness from the steel reinforcements, causing them to buckle under the weight of the floors above the fires.<p>[This message has been edited by WampusCat (edited 11-05-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||11-05-2001||11:16 AM||||Saw K-PAX this weekend<P>it was filmed in NYC<P>and Im pretty sure they edited it to take out any shots with the WTC in the background.<P> in fact, they may have reshot some sceans.||||reg||11
Z||000006||BN Boomer||11-05-2001||12:36 PM||||I watched Armageddon on the home theater system a couple of weeks ago. It's kind of weird and eerie to watch the part when the meteor shower strikes New York and in the aftermath you see the World Trade Center heavily damaged, with the top of one the twin towers completely destroyed and smoking. To me, it was totally reminiscent of the terrorist attack and actually rekindled some of the feelings I had about the attack.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Screwie||11-05-2001||01:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierospeeder:<BR><B><BR>No im not racist but heres a story.  I worked at my dads work during the summer/winter days off from school.  And there was a middleeastern college kid.  He accused me of sexual harassment, freaking joke.  And they told me i had to leave when i start school up again.  <P>Only reason he did it, was 1, he didn't like me, or 2 it was a pathetic excuse for him not to work because 7am was to early and 8 hour days are too long.    I work with several black guys, they were the best friends i had there.  We would joke around, and they would say, ya, those people are back stabbers.   <P>they said this was my 2nd chance and i blew it, because i insulted some guy before, 3 years ago.  So they said i have a "history".  But those 3 years, i never gotten into trouble.   It did suck in some ways, it was a machine shop setting, so i got to learn about polishing, grinding, i got to sand blast.  mop the floor woohoo.  <P><BR>My mom was watching cable.  We got cable in our trailer home.  Just joking.  <BR>They had a thing about the middle easterns.  When i looked on the screen, they were doing public executions.  It doesn't look too governmental.  Some guy in rags, cuts the guy with a knife.  And theres just people running around in the background.  I just totally hate their culture, and it is sick.  Not as sick as the other cultures i seen in asia and african tribes.  But to portray your culture as something close to god is a joke.  <P>I would hate to be a woman there.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The thing is, I bet you can tell the same story with an American/European or whatever you want in there, that's not something "middle eastern".  The culture, well to base it on the second you saw on TV is also not that good. Just think about how the same things in a different way might happen in the US (or Europe). Doesn't the US have the death penalty? Anyway, just try to put it in perspective and don't think all Middle Eastern people are bad, that's the most important. (I can know, one of my best friends is from the Middle East  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)||||reg||1
Z||000008||fierospeeder||11-05-2001||02:52 PM||||todays executions are a lot more "prisioner friendly"<P>the middle eastern one was just like a 17th century witch craft burning at the stake.<P>Or can i say that europe and the US are more advance of a country then the middle east?  Ive been to europe 3 times, I have family there and its a lot more civilized then the US.  Civilized in means that people have a lot more respect for each other.  Yes, there is crime and there is also europe most wanted on tv.  <P>What i seen on tv was just a mob of people killing couple of guys.  Just like riots in the US.  When cops get killed in riots we should call it executions.  But we really call that a crime.  There are other countries just as bad.<P>Africa tribes are still as same as they were hundred of years ago.  Just as primitive, and the same rituals.  Im not sure if sacrafices are still being done today, but there have been sacrafices in the 20th century.<P>Asia, has their annual parade.  I cant remember what country its in.  But theres large amounts of people walking on coal, sticking long needles through their mouths, sticking pins in their toungues, carrying heavy loads on a backpack which is secured by couple of pins piercing their back.<P>I think its in india?, that there is a river where bodys are put to be "rested", and theres kids and adults that bath while bodys are floating next to them.<P>Another country, shaves their hair, and brings all the hair to a temple where people worship together.  <P>what if your east of mecca, do you have to face west even if its behind you? or still face east?<P><BR>Theres a lot of stupid cultures, and civilizations.  I can say that europe and the US is a modern civilization eventhough we got devil worshippers, cults.  A while ago there was a cult who did a mass suicide for aliens.  We have the waco incident, and it was resolved by the fbi "accidently" setting fire to their building and it burned down, killing numerous followers.<P>We got wack jobs, that have their own religion, and believe its okay to abuse and starve children.  We got some of those in prison now, because they were caught.<P>freaking religion, got to start another thread.<P><BR>YES there are good and bad people.  Theres good cops and bad cops.  good cops give you a warning and obey the law, bad cops hate your fiero, give you a ticket, steal drug money, and do favors for the mob.  Theres good people everywhere, and the people do the wrong give a bad example for that group of people.  <P>When a culture is very disturbing and inhumane then i find it wrong.  Death and inhumane treatment isn't right.  And religion makes people do stupid things because their perspective is incorrect.  Just like reading Romeo and Juliet, Romeo kills himself because he was really gay, and juliet couldn't believe she was in the wrong.<P>Some people live their life by religion and thats scary.  As this war, it is the talibans holy war against the US.  And the president is evil, eventhough he's a president for only 4-8 years and george bush isn't our king.  And the people in congress are not as equally important as the president.  Its just stupid.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000009||MinnGreenGT||11-06-2001||12:37 PM||||I'll stick my comment to the original statement about movies... I watched "<A HREF="http://www.reel.com/movie.asp?MID=131677" TARGET=_blank>Someone Like You</A>" last week with my wife. There was one scene where 2 of the characters were looking at an apartment, and one commented "...what a great view of the World Trade Center."   ...mmm- creapy chills.||||reg||1
Z||000010||fierospeeder||11-06-2001||02:55 PM||||IF anyone is addicted to the simpsons like i am.<P>Theres an episode where, homer and his buddies are going to get wasted.  And they assign Barney(the biggest drunk ever) to be the designated driver.  When everyone is wasted, he drives all of them home, and barney takes homer's car for a joy ride.  <P>Homer hasn't seen his car for weeks, or barney.  Barney shows up in the limo.  But he gets out from the trunk.  Homer says "wheres my car", barney has no clue.<P>Homer gets his mail, and finds that his car is parked in New York, and it is going to be destroyed ??? i cant remember the correct idea they used.<P>Homer, and his family go to Newyork(may have been capital city) and he finds his car parked on the sidewalk between the World trade building.  His wipers have 1000 tickets underneath them.  <P>To cut it short,  homer has to wait for the parking cop, to pay his fine, and get his wheel lock off.  While waiting from 2-8pm.  He gets hungry and thirsty.  He drinks "russian?" crab juice.  He has the urge to pee, so he enters the World trade building.  He goes to the highest floor, and theres a sign that says out of order, please use other building.<P>Homer runs to the other building, to the top floor and takes a pee.  He makes a loud orgasm sound, uuuuuuuuuuuhhhhhhhhhhhh.  And finds the parking cop giving him another ticket, and doesn't have enough time to go downstairs and get his wheellock off.||||reg||1
